      <p class="lede">12 answer-first Q&amp;As on website + online booking + whatsapp integration for dermatology + skincare clinics in Nagpur, Maharashtra &mdash; costs in INR, compliance (Maharashtra Medical Council + MCI + ASCI medical advertising code), local landmarks (Civil Lines + Dhantoli + Ramdaspeth + Sitabuldi + Wardha Road), booking + patient-acquisition benchmarks, and how ITD GrowthLabs works with clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams.</p>
